  "name": "DevX Connector: Uptime.com template (Preview)",
  "description": "Demonstrates Template mode with Source Uptime.com using an incoming webhook. POST Uptime.com alerts to /webhook/devx/uptime-com; the connector maps the up/down state, service name, timestamp, and alert-details URL into the uptime template. Add a DevX Message Connector credential and configure DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_URL and DEVX_CONNECTOR_API_KEY. Use the Webhook test URL while editing, or activate the workflow and point Uptime.com at the production URL. Preview does not post to Teams; switch Mode to Send after reviewing the output.",
